      "writtenOn": "2020-07-31T19:08:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "An unbundled app build can\u0027t run dexpreopt (they don\u0027t have art in the manifest).  Adding the extra dependencies even if you don\u0027t run dexpreopt could cause issues if it causes a module to get marked as missing dependencies, but I think it should be OK since they would want those dependencies to compile against anyways.",
      "revId": "a7562956d57c486cfa27f63220ed24599bbe3cdb",
