      "writtenOn": "2020-08-03T13:17:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I thought an unbundled app build pulls in all the dependencies needed for dexpreopt. If it\u0027s not meant to do dexpreopt, then this patch makes no sense. And without the dexpreopt-enabled condition it breaks the build for apps that depend on missing compatibility libraries, e.g.:\n\n  module Gallery2 missing dependencies:\n    prebuilt_org.apache.http.legacy, \n    prebuilt_android.test.base,\n    prebuilt_android.test.mock\n\nSo I will probably abandon this patch and disable dexpreopt in Soong tests for unbundled builds (they were the primary reason why I did this change).",
